# ── CMake build trees ───────────────────────────────
# INSTALL.md uses `cmake -B build`; scikit-build-core uses build/{wheel_tag}
/build/
/build-*/
/cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeUserPresets.json
compile_commands.json

# ── Doxygen output (written into the source tree: docs/html) ──
/docs/html/

